{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123389","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123389/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123389/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123389/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123389","id":5417628025,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABQupxeQ","number":123389,"title":"Dictionary invariance not properly checked for `Variant` value type","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","color":"ff6055","default":true,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098082,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwODI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:gdscript","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":1327318271,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMzI3MzE4Mjcx","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/crash","name":"crash","color":"885544","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":1,"created_at":"2026-09-10T21:43:54Z","updated_at":"2026-09-13T13:56:32Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- v4.8.dev.custom_build [cb41ea115]\n\n### System information\n\nFedora 44\n\n### Issue description\n\nContainer types with different types are supposed to be invariant. However the GDScript analyzer does not catch a mismatch if the value type is `Variant` (this is probably an oversight from how the untyped exemption is implemented).\n\nThis can lead the analyzer to assume types that are not actually verified at runtime. The compiler can generate faulty bytecode based on those types which can lead to crashes in the worst case.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n```gdscript\n@tool\nextends EditorScrip\n\nfunc a() -> Dictionary[int, Variant]:\n\treturn {0: 1} as Dictionary[int, Variant]\n\nfunc b() -> Dictionary[int, String]:\n\treturn a()\n\nfunc _run() -> void:\n\tvar a := b()[0]\n\tprint(a.bigrams())\n```\n\n- Run the editor script in an arbitrary project\n- 💣 \n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123389/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123389/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}